# HK/TW content: route identity/playback APIs and overseas-only video CDN.
# Domain-level rules cannot distinguish HK/TW episodes from mainland episodes
# sharing api.bilibili.com / app.bilibili.com. That trade-off is intentional.
# Generic bilivideo.com and hdslb.com CDN must NOT be proxied wholesale.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bilibili.tv
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bstarstatic.com
DOMAIN,api.bilibili.com
DOMAIN,app.bilibili.com
DOMAIN,upos-hz-mirrorakam.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,upos-sz-mirrorakam.akamaized.net
